{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28234","headline":"过旧游见双鹤怆然有怀 · 李远","name":"过旧游见双鹤怆然有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公何岁掩松楸，双鹤依然傍玉楼。\n朱顶漓岏荒草上，雪毛零落小池头。\n蓬瀛路断君何在，云水情深我尚留。\n他日若来华表上，更添多少令威愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}